[
  {
    "text": "这条，好像快一点。",
    "startMs": 250,
    "endMs": 3650,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "为什么总是\n别人先走？",
    "startMs": 8250,
    "endMs": 12650,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "你看见了人数。",
    "startMs": 13250,
    "endMs": 17650,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "还没看见，\n每个人要处理什么。",
    "startMs": 18250,
    "endMs": 23650,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "一起开始。",
    "startMs": 24250,
    "endMs": 29650,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "左边4秒。\n右边还差一步。",
    "startMs": 30250,
    "endMs": 34650,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "人少，\n不一定工作少。",
    "startMs": 35250,
    "endMs": 39650,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "你挑的是队伍长度。\n影响等待的，还有任务。",
    "startMs": 40250,
    "endMs": 44650,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "这只是一个算例。",
    "startMs": 45250,
    "endMs": 49650,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "可我们熟悉的等待，\n远不止这一种。",
    "startMs": 50250,
    "endMs": 55650,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "投出去的简历，\n还没有回音。",
    "startMs": 60250,
    "endMs": 64650,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "做了一半的作品，\n还看不出样子。",
    "startMs": 65250,
    "endMs": 69650,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "周围却不断有人\n交出结果。",
    "startMs": 70250,
    "endMs": 74650,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "我是不是，\n慢了？",
    "startMs": 78000,
    "endMs": 80650,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "原来离开队伍，\n我还在排队。",
    "startMs": 81250,
    "endMs": 84650,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "我把别人的结果，\n当成了自己的刻度。",
    "startMs": 85250,
    "endMs": 89650,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "于是，\n刚开始又想换一条。",
    "startMs": 90250,
    "endMs": 94650,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "可是，\n有些期限真的存在。",
    "startMs": 95250,
    "endMs": 99650,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "一句“别着急”，\n不能替我做决定。",
    "startMs": 100250,
    "endMs": 105650,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "先看清，\n我究竟在等什么。",
    "startMs": 106250,
    "endMs": 109650,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "有些，要等。",
    "startMs": 110250,
    "endMs": 114650,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "有些，可以先做。",
    "startMs": 115250,
    "endMs": 119650,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "比较之前，\n先弄清条件。",
    "startMs": 120250,
    "endMs": 124650,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "那些看似同一条的路……",
    "startMs": 125250,
    "endMs": 130650,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "并不共用\n一把刻度。",
    "startMs": 131250,
    "endMs": 134650,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "我仍然要往前。",
    "startMs": 135250,
    "endMs": 139650,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "先看清，再往前。",
    "startMs": 145250,
    "endMs": 148800,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  }
